# ---- Secrets / environment (NEVER commit) ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
secrets/
vault/data/
# The AppRole secret-id `tools/vault_setup.py` writes (`FRD-116`). `secrets/` above covers the
# default directory already; a credential's exclusion is named rather than left to a pattern
# written for something else. The second line is the path older checkouts of the tool write to.
deploy/compose/secrets/
deploy/compose/.vault-secret-id

